{
 "titulo": "A King Tried to Ban Coffee ☕",
 "texto_pantalla": "BANNED?",
 "lote": "C2026112101",
 "tema": "cafe",
 "frases": [
  "In 1675, a king tried to ban coffee.",
  "King Charles the Second ordered every coffee house in England to close.",
  "The reason: people sat there for hours, sharing news and gossip about the government.",
  "The ban would start on January 10th.",
  "London got angry. Fast.",
  "Two days before the deadline, the king backed down.",
  "The coffee houses stayed open.",
  "So, tell me if you'd give up coffee for a king.",
  "Follow for more banned coffee stories."
 ],
